+ "As recompensas do KVM têm 3 categorias: Arma, Armadura e Acessório."
- "There are 3 types of Armor rewards and they require 840/630/580 KVM points fo each."
+ "Há 3 tipos de armadura de recompensa, a 840/630/580 pontos KVM cada."
- "There are enemies coming! Let's evacuate from here!"
+ "Inimigos chegando! Vamos evacuar daqui!"
